# Data files
# - data/game-exports/ = Raw exports (has own .gitignore - ignores all JSON files)
# - data/rules/ = Game rules and mechanics (tracked - our formulas/mappings)
# - data/processing/ = Intermediate files (has own .gitignore - ignores all except README)
# - data/processed/ = Processed data (tracked - output of process-game-data.cjs)
# - public/data/ = Compiled pages (ignored - generated at build time)
public/data/
